  "rubric": "# Outbound in thirty seconds\n\nPoster at 3 seconds. Preview 3, 10, 18 and 26 seconds: the first name and company read on the hook, the pain sentence fits on two lines at most, the proof number fills the frame without clipping, and the ask carries the call to action and the sender. The logo stays in the top-right corner on every beat.",
  "provenance": {
    "label": "CueFrame, the Clay starter",
    "notes": "Sample logo is the CueFrame wordmark; a row supplies the prospect logo."
  },
